1202:In Figure 6, we provide a comparison between TSNPSE, SNPSE-A, and SNPSE-B, for two of the benchmark tasks described in Lueckmann et al. (2021) (SLCP and GLU). We omit the corresponding results for SNPSE-C since, in our empirical testing, this method failed to provide meaningful results (e.g., C2ST $\approx 1$ ). This, we suspect, is due to the significant approximation error incurred when estimating the score of the proposal prior, as described in Section C.4.3.
